OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStorm Boelo brings widespread
OL,6,Fwesterly severe gales, easing from the
OL,7,Fwest later in the day. Frequent
OL,8,Fshowers in the morning, heavy at
OL,9,Ftimes, with drier interludes
OL,10,Fdeveloping from the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FStill quite windy at first,
OL,13,Fparticularly towards the North Sea
OL,14,Fcoast, but gradually easing through
OL,15,Fthe evening and overnight. Scattered
OL,16,Fshowers from the west in the evening,
OL,17,Feasing off overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
