OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FMostly dry and with some
OL,6,Fbrightness to start. Cloud and rain
OL,7,Fspread north through the morning.
OL,8,FDrier for a time in the afternoon
OL,9,Fbefore more rain in evening. Becoming
OL,10,Fwindy.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FVery
OL,13,Fwindy on Tuesday with showers, some
OL,14,Fheavy. Winds easing overnight into
OL,15,FWednesday, then bright spells and
OL,16,Fscattered showers. Dry Thursday with
OL,17,Fbright spells and variable cloud.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
